<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the fresh, tender grass Jesus makes me lie down;</l><l>He leads me by waters of rest;</l><l>No more struggle and strain; all self-effort is vain;</l><l>In the flow I am perfectly blessed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus called me one day to the Holiest Place,</l><l>To live in His presence divine;</l><l>Hallelujah, I’ve heard an encouraging word:</l><l>“Abide—you’re a branch in the vine.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
